{"content": "# 書\n![float-right](./api/kotoba/book/thumbnails/thumb_architecture.webp?v=d9b090ce#full=./projects/archive/02_kotoba/articles/02_book/architecture.webp?v=a20bbebe&w=1638&h=1638)\n\n<div class=\"tab-buttons\">\n<button class=\"tab-btn active\" onclick=\"window.switchTabPanel('p-1', this, 'Group')\">經過</button>\n<button class=\"tab-btn\" onclick=\"window.switchTabPanel('p-2', this, 'Group')\">While</button>\n<button class=\"tab-btn\" onclick=\"window.switchTabPanel('p-3', this, 'Group')\">しばらく</button>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"p-1\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-group=\"Group\" style=\"display: block;\">\n\n「書一直都在，興許妳會到達那個決定閱讀她的時間點。」\n\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"p-2\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-group=\"Group\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div id=\"lang-en\">\n\n“The book is still there. Perhaps you will reach the moment when you decide to read it.”\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"p-3\" class=\"tab-panel\" data-group=\"Group\" style=\"display: none;\">\n\n:::lang[ja]\n「本はずっとそこに。いつか、あなたがその本を読もうと決める時が来るかも。」\n:::\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"md-tab-end\"></div>", "hashes": {"projects/archive/02_kotoba/articles/02_book/architecture.webp": "dff5aac3", "md_source": "f2e4cd72", "og_cover": "dff5aac3", "thumb_cover": "dff5aac3", "art_detail": "0161a832"}}